      "primary_source_citations_organized_by_": "Primary-source citations organized by module — textbooks, peer-reviewed articles, legal rulings, and online resources. For students heading to grad school or anyone who wants to go deeper.",
      "primary_sources_for_the_claims_framewo": "Primary sources for the claims, frameworks, and numerical estimates used throughout this tool. Organized by module. For claims not cited here, the basis is standard material found in any graduate-level intellectual/psychoeducational assessment text (e.g., Sattler; Flanagan & Harrison; Reynolds et al.).",
