      "protection": "● protection",
      "provide_definition_score_2_make_smalle": "Provide definition. Score: 2 = \"make smaller,\" 1 = \"reduce,\" 0 = \"hide\" or unrelated.",
      "public_speaking_desc": "6 sections: foundations, structures (problem-solution-action, Pixar spine, SCQA, TED, inverted pyramid, rule of 3), slide design, delivery skills, managing nerves (~75% of adults have it), Q+A handling. Skill that compounds in value across careers.",
      "read_each_word_aloud_don_t_guess_if_yo": "Read each word aloud. Don't guess if you don't know.",
      "read_real_world_test_claims_rate_each_": "Read real-world test claims. Rate each: Legit / Suspect / Pseudoscience. Learn the tells that expose Barnum effects, popularity appeals, proprietary black boxes, and commercial inflation. Capstone challenge.",
      "read_the_passage_answer_4_multiple_cho": "Read the passage. Answer 4 multiple-choice questions about main idea, inference, vocab in context, detail.",
      "read_these_made_up_words_aloud_they_fo": "Read these made-up words aloud. They follow English rules.",
      "real_cognitive_batteries": "Real Cognitive Batteries",
      "real_cognitive_batteries_2": "📖 Real Cognitive Batteries",
      "reasonable_reliability_but_report_the_": "Reasonable reliability but report the confidence interval — never the point estimate alone.",
      "recommended_modules": "Recommended modules: ",
      "reliability_0_70_0_85_fine_for_routine": "Reliability 0.70-0.85 — fine for routine screening, NOT for placement or eligibility decisions.",
      "reliability_0_70_error_variance_30_of_": "Reliability < 0.70 — error variance ≥ 30% of total variance. Acceptable for some group-level research questions, but the confidence interval around any individual score is too wide for high-stakes individual decisions (placement, eligibility, diagnosis).",
      "reliability_inquiry_capstone_sandbox": "Reliability Inquiry — Capstone Sandbox",
