      "vampire_squid_ink_is_replaced_by_glowi": "Vampire squid ink is replaced by glowing bioluminescent mucus — at their habitat depth (200-1000 m), ink would be useless.",
      "vampire_squid_release_bioluminescent_m": "Vampire squid release bioluminescent mucus from their arm tips when threatened. The glow lasts up to 9 minutes — long enough to swim away while the predator chases the false trail.",
