      "is_the_single_number_that_determines_d": " is the single number that determines drag. Lower = less fuel wasted. The EV (0.53) beats the truck (1.34) by 2.5×.",
      "it_s_only_12_30_am_let_s_go_get_pizza_": "\"It's only 12:30 AM, let's go get pizza. You're 17 — nobody checks GDL curfew anyway.\"",
