      "pick_a_hypothetical_project_setting_pr": "Pick a hypothetical project setting. Predict how investment, time, community, and intervention complexity combine. No score, no reveal. (Note: this slider is intervention complexity, NOT biodiversity — higher biodiversity generally INCREASES resilience.)",
