      "1_always_use_local_exhaust_ventilation": "1. ALWAYS use local exhaust ventilation (LEV) on every weld, not just stainless. 2. Wear hearing protection on the shop floor, not just when grinding. 3. Take micro-breaks every 30-60 min for posture reset. 4. Get a doctor who knows occupational medicine; do annual spirometry. 5. Know your OSHA right to a clean shop + report violations without retaliation.",
